          "message": {
            "text": "ViewTimeline transform ownership is deliberately split by Blink subject type. The same fixed-scroll mutation requires the HTML/CSS LayoutBox projective quad to change without retiming, but requires the SVG child mapped bounds and percentage to change; holding all three effects separately from their moving source prevents either branch from being generalized into an answer table.",
