          "message": {
            "text": "Document animation enumeration proves only one TreeScope. The live main/OOPIF control begins with three document plus one open-shadow and one closed-shadow progress animation per target; after cancelling only document animations, strict capture succeeds while both shadow animations remain live, authenticating the current silent boundary rather than merely citing source.",
            "markdown": "Document animation enumeration proves only one TreeScope. The live main/OOPIF control begins with three document plus one open-shadow and one closed-shadow progress animation per target; after cancelling only document animations, strict capture succeeds while both shadow animations remain live, authenticating the current silent boundary rather than merely citing source."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
