          "message": {
            "text": "A pre-navigation Playwright clock freezes only the benign replaced-global path. With fake performance time and those counters unchanged, page-visible saved-native callbacks and dedicated-worker rAF messages both advance in main and OOPIF; source fingerprints and target ids therefore cannot upgrade this shim into complete rAF ownership.",
            "markdown": "A pre-navigation Playwright clock freezes only the benign replaced-global path. With fake performance time and those counters unchanged, page-visible saved-native callbacks and dedicated-worker rAF messages both advance in main and OOPIF; source fingerprints and target ids therefore cannot upgrade this shim into complete rAF ownership."
          },
